1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,593
Signs are everything, and we take the system's point of view.

2
00:00:03,593 --> 00:00:09,361
Anything coming in is positive: heat absorbed, or work done on the system by compressing it.

3
00:00:09,361 --> 00:00:16,432
Anything going out is negative: heat released, or work done by the system as it expands.

